# Local state is the zero-cost default for this single-operator hobby cluster.
# Do not commit state. To migrate later, add a real backend block and run:
# tofu init -migrate-state
#
# DigitalOcean Spaces is S3-compatible but adds a monthly cost and does not
# provide DynamoDB-style state locking. A hosted OpenTofu-compatible backend is
# preferable once CI is allowed to apply infrastructure.
